#: src/ch03-01-transactions.md:3
msgid ""
"Understanding Starknet's transaction types is essential to master its "
"architecture and capabilities. Each transaction type serves a unique "
"purpose, and getting a grip on their differences is crucial for proficient "
"Starknet usage."
