#: src/ch03-08-smart-contracts.md:9
msgid ""
"Having explained what starknet smart contracts are, we'll be writing a "
"moderately simple contract called a Piggy Bank contract, this example will "
"demonstrate how to write a smart contract using the factory pattern and also "
"how to integrate the starknet component system into your smart contracts."
