#: src/ch04-03-standard-account.md:571
msgid ""
"Starknet's simulation feature allows developers to estimate the gas cost of "
"transactions without actually committing them to the network. This is "
"particularly useful during development and testing phases. The `estimate-"
"only` flag available in tools like Starkli triggers the simulation process. "
"To differentiate between actual transaction execution and simulation, "
"Starknet uses a version offset strategy."
