msgstr ""

#: src/ch04-05-02-multisig.md:190
msgid ""
"In addition, we will create a separate trait annotated with the interface "
"attribute that will group all the functions in the account contract that is "
"expected to interact with. On the other hand, we will auto generate the "
"trait for all those functions that users will not see to use directly even "
"though they are public."
